  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Palm oil.Beneficiaries: 3117 (1090 women).Description: The group seeks to increase production of palm oil through increase in the area under production with new high-yielding oil palm plants and the acquisition of equipment to mechanize the oil production process to increase the quantity and quality of oil produced.</narrative>
